      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property is delighted to bring to the market No. 67 Annaverna Road, Ard Easmuinn, Dundalk a stunning detached bungalow that has recently undergone a complete transformation.\r\n\r\nThis property represents the very best of modern living in one of Dundalk’s most established areas. All works have been carried out to an extremely high standard, with the addition of a stunning new kitchen/dining/living room extension with bespoke fitted kitchen and double doors to the outdoors. The master suite has a newly constructed en-suite bathroom fitted to a luxurious modern standard and the newly fitted family bathroom exudes style and luxury.\r\n\r\nThe recent refurbishment at No. 67 Annaverna Drive has created an open-plan living space which is flooded with natural light with 9ft high ceilings throughout and flows seamlessly onto the new patio/terrace creating the perfect area for entertaining.\r\n\r\nExternally to the front the property has been transformed with an extended tarmac driveway with new kerbing and attractive landscaping.\r\n\r\nThis is a super opportunity to acquire a home in a very sought after area on the edge of town, perfect for families, those looking to move close to town. Bungalow’s of this quality style and finish, always attract strong attention. For all further inquiries contact Blue Sky Property on 0429329333. Guide Price €525,000.\r\n\r\nLocation: Ard Easmuinn offers the perfect balance of convenience and prestige. This home is within walking distance of Clarke Railway Station, the newly refurbished Derryhale Hotel, Dundalk Town Centre, Lis Na Dara Medical Centre, Dundalk Grammar Schools, The Friary NS, Oriel Park, and all local amenities. The M1 Dublin Belfast Motorway is a short driveway away, making commuting a realistic option. \r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
